Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, headsetcontrol (>= 4.3.0), systemsettings, plasma-workspace, qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts
Description: Headset page and panel entry for USB gaming headsets
 A Headset page in System Settings, a panel entry that appears only while a
 headset is connected, and a user service that sends the saved choices to a
 headset when it appears and tells when its battery is low. The headsets and
 what each can do come from HeadsetControl.
